            CompilationUnit cu = parseCompilationUnit(languageLevel, s);
        });
    }

    @ParameterizedTest
    @EnumSource(value = ParserConfiguration.LanguageLevel.class, names = {"JAVA_14_PREVIEW", "JAVA_15_PREVIEW", "JAVA_16", "JAVA_16_PREVIEW"})
